                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: A niece is the daughter of one's brother or sister.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is a family tree?\n2. How is a family tree used?\n3. What are the different limbs of a family tree?\n4. What is the purpose of adding a new limb to a family tree?\n\nAnswers:\n1. A family tree is a diagram that shows the relationships between members of a family.\n2. A family tree is used to trace one's ancestry and to keep track of family members.\n3. The different limbs of a family tree represent different generations of a family. For example, the first limb represents the parents, the second limb represents their children, and so on.\n4. The purpose of adding a new limb to a family tree is to include a new family member and to show their relationship to the rest of the family.\n\nTherefore, the answer is D) family tree.",
