                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "The correct answer is B) eat every day.\n\nTo stay healthy, a person needs to take care of their physical and mental well-being. One of the most important things a person can do to maintain good health is to eat a balanced diet every day. This means consuming a variety of foods from all the different food groups, including fruits, vegetables, whole grains, lean proteins, and healthy fats.\n\nOther things a person can do to stay healthy include getting regular exercise, getting enough sleep, managing stress, staying hydrated, avoiding harmful substances like tobacco and excessive alcohol, and getting regular check-ups with a healthcare provider.\n\nOptions A, D, and E are symptoms or characteristics that may indicate a person is not healthy, while option C is a state of emotion that is not directly related to physical health.",
