                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the desired level of doneness when cooking sheep meat?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- Sheep meat can refer to meat from a ram or a lamb.\n- The options \"ram\" and \"wolf\" are not related to the question.\n- The word \"well\" suggests that the question is asking about the level of doneness.\n- Therefore, the answer is C) done.\n\nAnswer: C) done.",
