                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What are the possible outcomes if James decides to compete?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- James has decided to compete.\n- If he doesn't compete, there is a defined outcome (presumably something negative).\n- If he competes, there are several possible outcomes.\n- Option A: He might win.\n- Option B: He might perform better than expected, even if he doesn't win.\n- Option C: He might make enemies (this is not necessarily a positive or negative outcome, but it is a possibility).\n- Option D: There will be winners and losers, as is typical in a competition.\n- Option E: He might lose.\n\nAnswer: The possible outcomes if James decides to compete are: he might win, he might perform better, he might make enemies, there will be winners and losers, or he might lose.",
