                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: Competing involves participating in a contest or competition with the goal of winning or performing well. There are usually winners and losers in competitions, and there may be enemies or rivals involved.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What are the potential benefits of competing?\n2. What are the potential risks or downsides of competing?\n3. How can James increase his chances of winning or performing well?\n4. Who are James' competitors or potential enemies?\n5. What is the likelihood of James winning or losing if he competes?\n\nAnswers:\n1. The potential benefits of competing include the opportunity to win, perform well, gain recognition or rewards, and improve skills or abilities.\n2. The potential risks or downsides of competing include the possibility of losing, facing criticism or disappointment, and experiencing stress or pressure.\n3. James can increase his chances of winning or performing well by practicing, preparing thoroughly, staying focused and motivated, and learning from past experiences.\n4. James' competitors or potential enemies may include other participants in the competition, people who are jealous or resentful of his success, or individuals who have a personal vendetta against him.\n5. The likelihood of James winning or losing if he competes depends on various factors, such as his level of skill and preparation, the strength of his competition, and any external factors that may affect the outcome (such as luck or unforeseen circumstances).",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "7009709f-2da2-4e56-8304-805de879c7c3",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "that any of them could happen if James competes. It is impossible to determine the exact outcome without more information about the specific competition and James' abilities and preparation.",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
