                        "cot_trigger": "zhou-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: Identify the findings on the ultrasound.\nThe ultrasound shows an intrauterine heteroechoic mass with numerous anechoic spaces and no identifiable fetus or amniotic fluid. This suggests a molar pregnancy. The ovaries are enlarged and have multiple thin-walled, septated cysts with clear content.\n\nStep 2: Determine the most likely cause of the ovarian findings.\nThe most likely cause of the ovarian findings in this case is theca lutein cysts. Theca lutein cysts are associated with molar pregnancies and are caused by excessive production of human chorionic gonadotropin (hCG) by the placenta. This leads to overstimulation of the ovaries and the development of multiple cysts.\n\nStep 3: Eliminate the other answer choices.\nA) Chocolate cysts: Chocolate cysts are a type of ovarian cyst that is filled with old blood. They are typically associated with endometriosis and would not be expected in this case.\nB) Corpus luteum cysts: Corpus luteum cysts are a type of functional ovarian cyst that forms after ovulation. They typically resolve on their own and would not be expected to cause the findings seen on the ultrasound.\nC) Yolk sac tumor: Yolk sac tumors are a type of ovarian germ cell tumor that can cause elevated levels of hCG. However, they typically present with a solid mass and would not be expected to cause the cystic changes seen on the ultrasound.\nD) Luteoma of pregnancy: Luteomas are rare ovarian tumors that can occur during pregnancy. They are typically benign and do not produce hCG. They would not be expected to cause the findings seen on the ultrasound.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E) Theca lutein cysts.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "28ef060e-2e74-4054-89b3-84c748b8da11",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
