                    {
                        "id": "f74d9d58-77fe-48f8-b339-99d6899770c8",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: The LOD (logarithm of odds) score is a statistical measure used to determine the likelihood of two loci being located near each other on a chromosome. A LOD score of 3 or higher is generally considered strong evidence for linkage, while a LOD score of less than 1 is considered evidence against linkage.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is a LOD score?\n2. What does a LOD score of less than 1 indicate?\n3. What does a LOD score of less than 3 indicate?\n4. What does a LOD score of less than 2 indicate?\n5. What does a LOD score of greater than 3 indicate?\n6. Which LOD score would suggest that two loci have a high probability of being closely linked?\n\nAnswers:\n1. A LOD score is a statistical measure used to determine the likelihood of two loci being located near each other on a chromosome. It is calculated by comparing the likelihood of observing a set of genetic data if the two loci are linked versus if they are not linked.\n2. A LOD score of less than 1 indicates evidence against linkage between the two loci.\n3. A LOD score of less than 3 indicates weak evidence against linkage between the two loci.\n4. A LOD score of less than 2 indicates moderate evidence against linkage between the two loci.\n5. A LOD score of greater than 3 indicates strong evidence for linkage between the two loci.\n6. Based on the answer to sub-questions 2-5, the answer is D) LOD Score > 3. A LOD score of greater than 3 would suggest strong evidence for linkage between the two loci, indicating that the novel mutation in the CFTR gene is likely closely linked to the \u0394F508 mutation.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "f59f6d08-2e7a-445e-9e8c-d527384c3470",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) LOD Score > 3.",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/03/30 03:54:36",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-3.5-turbo', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
