                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To determine if the child has been infected with HIV, the hospital would need to detect the genetic material of the virus. The most sensitive and specific test for this purpose is the polymerase chain reaction (PCR). Therefore, the hospital would use PCR to detect HIV genetic material in the baby's blood sample.\n\nAnswer: D) Polymerase chain reaction.",
