orepinephrine and serotonin in the brain. Citalopram is an SSRI that increases the levels of serotonin in the brain.\n4. Binge eating and purging behavior is commonly associated with bulimia nervosa, which is often treated with selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRIs). However, there is",
