 of scleroderma. However, as mentioned earlier, scleroderma is less likely in this patient based on the clinical findings.\n- Anti-Jo-1 antibody: This antibody is associated with polymyositis and dermatomyositis, but as mentioned earlier, these disorders are less likely in this patient based on the clinical findings.\n- Anti-Scl-70 antibodies: This antibody",
