                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": " C, Adenosine deaminase deficiency. Adenosine deaminase deficiency is a primary immunodeficiency disorder that is characterized by absent thymic shadow, failure to gain weight, chronic diarrhea, and recurrent bacterial and viral infections.",
