fective option for first-trimester abortions and is appropriate for this patient.\n\nStep 6: Choose the most appropriate option.\n- Based on the patient's gestational age and desire for pregnancy termination, the most appropriate option is C) Manual uterine aspiration or E) Oral mifepristone + misoprostol. Both options are safe and effective for first-trimester abortions. The final decision should be made in consultation with the patient and her healthcare provider.",
