                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: There are different types of diabetes, including type 1, type 2, gestational, and others. Type 2 diabetes is the most common form and is often associated with obesity and insulin resistance. Risk factors for type 2 diabetes include age, family history, obesity, physical inactivity, and certain medications.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is the most likely form of diabetes in this patient?\n2. What are the risk factors for this form of diabetes?\n3. Which of the answer choices is consistent with this form of diabetes?\n\nAnswer:\n1. Based on the patient's age, obesity, and insulin resistance, the most likely form of diabetes is type 2 diabetes.\n2. Risk factors for type 2 diabetes include age, family history, obesity, physical inactivity, and certain medications. This patient has several of these risk factors, including age and obesity.\n3. Answer choice C, pancreatic islet cell leukocyte infiltration, is consistent with type 1 diabetes, which is an autoimmune disorder. Answer choice B, pancreatic islet cell amyloid deposition, is associated with type 2 diabetes but is not the most likely cause in this patient. Answer choice A, strong HLA class II gene makeup, is also associated with type 1 diabetes but is not the most likely cause in this patient. Answer choice D, auto-antibodies against pancreatic islet cell antigens, is also associated with type 1 diabetes but is not mentioned in the patient's presentation. Therefore, answer choice E, unrelated to his abdominal obesity, is not consistent with the patient's most likely form of diabetes. The correct answer is B) Pancreatic islet cell amyloid deposition.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "ce664d96-6b9c-4f9c-b54c-838bed482add",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
