                        "cot": "What is the most appropriate pharmacotherapy for a 24-year-old man with chronic back pain who presents with symptoms of anxiety, nausea, abdominal cramping, vomiting, and diarrhea?\n\nHelpful knowledge: The patient has chronic back pain and is experiencing symptoms of opioid withdrawal. He denies using illicit drugs, but it is possible that he has been taking prescription opioids for his chronic pain.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What are the symptoms of opioid withdrawal?\n2. What is the mechanism of action of each of the listed medications?\n3. Which medication is used to treat opioid withdrawal?\n4. What are the potential side effects of each medication?\n5. Which medication is contraindicated in a patient with chronic back pain?\n\nAnswers:\n1. Symptoms of opioid withdrawal include anxiety, nausea, abdominal cramping, vomiting, diarrhea, dilated pupils, diaphoresis, piloerection, and tachycardia.\n2. Lorazepam is a benzodiazepine that acts as an anxiolytic and sedative. Naltrexone is an opioid antagonist that blocks the effects of opioids. Methadone is a long-acting opioid agonist that can be used to treat opioid addiction. Morphine is a short-acting opioid agonist that is used for pain relief. Naloxone is an opioid antagonist that can reverse the effects of opioids.\n3. Methadone is the medication used to treat opioid withdrawal.\n4. The potential side effects of lorazepam include drowsiness, dizziness, and confusion. The potential side effects of naltrexone include nausea, headache, and dizziness. The potential side effects of methadone include drowsiness, dizziness, and constipation. The potential side effects of morphine include respiratory depression, sedation, and nausea. The potential side effects of naloxone include rapid heart rate, sweating, and tremors.\n5. Morphine is contraindicated in a patient with chronic back pain who is experiencing symptoms of opioid withdrawal. Methadone is the most appropriate pharmacotherapy for this patient.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "0a38d112-3cdc-4111-8fb6-56ce746bd438",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) Methadone.",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
